  "notes": [
    "**Sentar** is a stem-changing verb: e→ie",
    "Present: stem change e→ie (except nosotros)",
    "Preterite: regular -AR endings, NO stem change",
    "Imperfect: regular -AR pattern, NO stem change",
    "Often used reflexively: **sentarse** (to sit down)",
    "Can also mean \"to suit\" or \"to fit\": *Te sienta bien ese color* (That color suits you)",
    "Common usage: *Siéntate aquí* (Sit down here), *Me senté en la silla* (I sat down on the chair)",
    "Don't confuse with **sentir** (to feel) - different verb!"
  ],
